                                            *                                                                               D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\usb_device.c
                                            * Overview:        This routine handles an IN transaction according to          D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\usb_device.c
